#: eventyay/control/forms/global_settings.py:886
msgid ""
"During the update check, eventyay will report an anonymous, unique "
"installation ID, the current version of the system and your installed "
"plugins and the number of active and inactive events in your installation to "
"servers operated by the eventyay developers. We will only store anonymous "
"data, never any IP addresses and we will not know who you are or where to "
"find your instance. You can disable this behavior here at any time."
msgstr ""
"Semasa semakan kemas kini, eventyay akan melaporkan ID pemasangan unik tanpa "
"nama, versi semasa sistem, pemalam yang dipasang, serta bilangan acara aktif "
"dan tidak aktif dalam pemasangan anda kepada pelayan yang dikendalikan oleh "
"pembangun eventyay. Kami hanya akan menyimpan data tanpa nama, tidak akan "
"menyimpan sebarang alamat IP, dan kami tidak akan tahu siapa anda atau di "
"mana hendak mencari instance anda. Anda boleh melumpuhkan tingkah laku ini "
"di sini pada bila-bila masa."

