"Helo,\n"
"\n"
"anda meminta kata laluan baharu. Sila pergi ke halaman berikut untuk "
"menetapkan semula kata laluan anda:\n"
"\n"
"%(url)s\n"
"\n"
"Salam hormat,\n"
"Pasukan sistem anda\n"

#: eventyay/control/templates/pretixcontrol/email/invitation.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"You have been added to the following event team:\n"
"\n"
"Organizer: %(organizer)s\n"
"Team: %(team)s\n"
"\n"
"Click the following link to view your team dashboard:\n"
"\n"
"%(url)s\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
"\n"
"Your event team\n"
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"Anda telah ditambahkan ke pasukan acara berikut:\n"
"\n"
"Penganjur: %(organizer)s\n"
"Pasukan: %(team)s\n"
"\n"
"Klik pautan berikut untuk melihat papan pemuka pasukan anda:\n"
"\n"
"%(url)s\n"
"\n"
"Salam hormat,\n"
"\n"
"Pasukan acara anda\n"

#: eventyay/control/templates/pretixcontrol/email/invitation.txt:15
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"You have been invited to the following event team:\n"
"\n"
"Organizer: %(organizer)s\n"
"Team: %(team)s\n"
"\n"
"If you want to join that team, just click on the following link:\n"
"\n"
"%(url)s\n"
"\n"
"If you do not want to join, you can safely ignore or delete this email.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
"\n"
"Your event team\n"
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"Anda telah dijemput ke pasukan acara berikut:\n"
"\n"
"Penganjur: %(organizer)s\n"
"Pasukan: %(team)s\n"
"\n"
"Jika anda mahu menyertai pasukan tersebut, klik sahaja pautan berikut:\n"
"\n"
"%(url)s\n"
"\n"
"Jika anda tidak mahu menyertai, anda boleh abaikan atau padam e-mel ini "
"dengan selamat.\n"
"\n"
"Salam hormat,\n"
"\n"
"Pasukan acara anda\n"

#: eventyay/control/templates/pretixcontrol/email/security_notice.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"this is to inform you that the account information of your eventyay account "
"has been\n"
"changed. In particular, the following changes have been performed:\n"
"\n"
"%(messages)s\n"
"\n"
"If this change was not performed by you, please contact us immediately.\n"
"\n"
"You can review and change your account settings here:\n"
"\n"
"%(url)s\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
"Your system team\n"
msgstr ""
"Helo,\n"
"\n"
"ini untuk memaklumkan bahawa maklumat akaun akaun eventyay anda telah\n"
"diubah. Khususnya, perubahan berikut telah dibuat:\n"
"\n"
"%(messages)s\n"
"\n"
"Jika perubahan ini bukan dilakukan oleh anda, sila hubungi kami dengan "
"segera.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh menyemak dan mengubah tetapan akaun anda di sini:\n"
"\n"
"%(url)s\n"
"\n"
"Salam hormat,\n"
"Pasukan sistem anda\n"

