#: eventyay/control/templates/pretixcontrol/giftcards/checkout.html:4
msgid ""
"\n"
"        If you have a gift card, please enter the gift card code here. If "
"the gift card does not have\n"
"        enough credit to pay for the full order, you will be shown this page "
"again and you can either\n"
"        redeem another gift card or select a different payment method for "
"the difference.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Jika anda mempunyai kad hadiah, sila masukkan kod kad hadiah di "
"sini. Jika kad hadiah tidak mempunyai\n"
"        kredit yang mencukupi untuk membayar keseluruhan pesanan, anda akan "
"melihat halaman ini semula dan anda boleh sama ada\n"
"        menebus kad hadiah lain atau memilih kaedah pembayaran berbeza untuk "
"baki tersebut.\n"
"    "

#: eventyay/control/templates/pretixcontrol/giftcards/checkout_confirm.html:4
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Your gift card will be used to pay for this order. If the credit on "
"the gift card is lower than the order total, you will be able to pay the\n"
"        difference with a different payment method. If the credit is higher "
"than the order total, you will be able to re-use the gift card in the "
"future.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Kad hadiah anda akan digunakan untuk membayar pesanan ini. Jika "
"kredit pada kad hadiah lebih rendah daripada jumlah pesanan, anda akan boleh "
"membayar\n"
"        baki tersebut dengan kaedah pembayaran lain. Jika kredit lebih "
"tinggi daripada jumlah pesanan, anda akan boleh menggunakan semula kad "
"hadiah pada masa hadapan.\n"
"    "

